From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 03:04:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] build: link our patched core (Rust 1.97.0, physical
 manifest path)

The fork links slothfulchat-web's patched core: apply-patches swaps the
never-inited deltachat-ios/libraries/deltachat-core-rust submodule for
a symlink to build/core. Two things in build-core.sh need to follow:

- rust-toolchain 1.91.1 -> 1.97.0. Our core bumps rusqlite to 0.40,
  whose libsqlite3-sys build script uses `cfg_select!`, unstable on
  1.91.1 (E0658). The patched core builds natively on 1.97.0.
- cargo gets the symlink's physical path. The patched core has
  `../../crates/...` and `../../vendor-crates/...` path dependencies,
  and cargo normalizes those lexically against the manifest path it is
  handed, so through the symlink they point into build/ios. The copy of
  libdeltachat.a reads from the same physical target dir.

build-core.sh still adds the iOS targets itself.
---
 rust-toolchain        |  2 +-
 scripts/build-core.sh | 10 +++++++---
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/rust-toolchain b/rust-toolchain
index 8d39474..acbb747 100644
--- a/rust-toolchain
+++ b/rust-toolchain
@@ -1 +1 @@
-1.91.1
+1.97.0
diff --git a/scripts/build-core.sh b/scripts/build-core.sh
index 17f6180..a3f1936 100755
--- a/scripts/build-core.sh
+++ b/scripts/build-core.sh
@@ -6,6 +6,10 @@ export PATH="$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH"
 
 FILENAME="libdeltachat.a"
 DIR="../deltachat-ios/libraries"
+# slothfulchat: deltachat-core-rust is a symlink to slothfulchat-web's
+# build/core, whose `../../` path dependencies cargo resolves lexically from
+# the path it is given, so give it the physical one.
+CORE=$(cd "$DIR/deltachat-core-rust" && pwd -P)
 
 # Delete old build, if any.
 rm -f "${DIR}/${FILENAME}"
@@ -22,13 +26,13 @@ rustup target add aarch64-apple-ios x86_64-apple-ios --toolchain `cat ../rust-to
 CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_LTO=true \
 CARGO_PROFILE_DEV_LTO=true \
 RUSTFLAGS="-C embed-bitcode=yes" \
-  cargo +`cat ../rust-toolchain` lipo --xcode-integ --no-sanitize-env --manifest-path "$DIR/deltachat-core-rust/deltachat-ffi/Cargo.toml"
+  cargo +`cat ../rust-toolchain` lipo --xcode-integ --no-sanitize-env --manifest-path "$CORE/deltachat-ffi/Cargo.toml"
 
 # cargo-lipo drops result in different folder, depending on the config.
 if [[ $CONFIGURATION = "Debug" ]]; then
-  SOURCE="$DIR/deltachat-core-rust/target/universal/debug/${FILENAME}"
+  SOURCE="$CORE/target/universal/debug/${FILENAME}"
 else
-  SOURCE="$DIR/deltachat-core-rust/target/universal/release/${FILENAME}"
+  SOURCE="$CORE/target/universal/release/${FILENAME}"
 fi
 
 # Copy compiled library to DIR.
